# Ledge hang: walking (Shift + W, 1.5 m/s) off the back of the small quarter's 1.2 m deck, the
# rider grabs the edge and hangs facing the wall, feet just above the ground (knees bent: the deck
# is lower than walk.hangDepth). Still holding W does nothing; a fresh tap of W pulls up (0.5 s)
# back onto the deck, a little back from the lip.
park lab
cmd 0 teleport -10 22.5 1.34 0
tap walk 10
hold up+slide 20..140
tap up 200
run 320
expect event hang{drop=1.2} within 100..112
expect skater.hang == 1 at 195
expect skater.pos.z < 0.3 at 195
expect skater.fwd.y < -0.99 at 195
expect event hangEnd{how=pull up} within 200..202
expect skater.hang == 0 at 300
expect skater.pos.z > 1.3 at 300
expect skater.pos.y < 23.33 at 300
expect no event footLand
expect no event bail
